{"title":"Career Roadmap · 3D Artist","role":"3D Artist","summary":"A 3D Artist creates digital three-dimensional assets and environments for video games, films, animation, advertising, AR/VR, product visualisation and virtual production.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc Game Design / Digital Art"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc in Game Design / Digital Art, this is a strong direct-entry career. The most important employability factors are portfolio quality, modelling ability, artistic fundamentals, software proficiency and production workflow knowledge."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"\"3D Artist\" is a broad title. A graduate should eventually specialise as a 3D Environment Artist, Character Artist, 3D Prop Artist, 3D Generalist, Technical Artist, 3D Animator, Hard-Surface Artist or 3D Visualisation Artist."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Student / 3D Art Intern"},{"text":"Modelling, texturing and artistic fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2027–2029"},{"text":"Junior 3D Artist"},{"text":"Production-ready assets and portfolio"}],[{"text":"2029–2032"},{"text":"3D Artist"},{"text":"Specialisation + real production"}],[{"text":"2032–2036"},{"text":"Senior 3D Artist"},{"text":"Complex assets, mentoring, optimisation"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Lead / Senior Specialist"},{"text":"Art direction or technical specialisation"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Art Director / Principal Artist / Technical Art Lead"},{"text":"Creative and technical leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a 3D Artist Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A 3D Artist converts concepts and ideas into three-dimensional digital assets."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the specialisation, work may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Sculpting"},{"text":"Texturing"},{"text":"UV unwrapping"},{"text":"Material creation"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"Environment creation"},{"text":"Character creation"},{"text":"Prop creation"},{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"Rigging"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Asset integration into game engines"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A game-focused 3D Artist may create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Concept","Model","UV","Texture","Material","Optimise","Engine Integration"]}]},{"heading":"Main 3D Career Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Do not remain a generic 3D Artist indefinitely."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Environment Artist"},{"type":"p","text":"Creates:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Buildings"},{"text":"Landscapes"},{"text":"Interiors"},{"text":"Streets"},{"text":"Forests"},{"text":"Game environments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Character Artist"},{"type":"p","text":"Creates:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human characters"},{"text":"Creatures"},{"text":"Clothing"},{"text":"Hair"},{"text":"Accessories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Prop Artist"},{"type":"p","text":"Creates:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Weapons"},{"text":"Furniture"},{"text":"Vehicles"},{"text":"Tools"},{"text":"Game objects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Hard-Surface Artist"},{"type":"p","text":"Focuses on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vehicles"},{"text":"Machines"},{"text":"Robots"},{"text":"Industrial objects"},{"text":"Sci-fi assets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. 3D Generalist"},{"type":"p","text":"Works across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Texturing"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"Animation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Technical Artist"},{"type":"p","text":"Bridges:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Art","Programming","Game Engine Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This can become a highly valuable long-term specialisation."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During B.Sc","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Artistic Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Drawing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perspective"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Form"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Light and shadow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3D Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D space"},{"text":"Coordinates"},{"text":"Geometry"},{"text":"Topology"},{"text":"Polygons"},{"text":"Normals"},{"text":"Transformations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Primary software"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Blender"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Cameras"},{"text":"Rendering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a portfolio of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Simple props"},{"text":"Furniture"},{"text":"Rooms"},{"text":"Basic environments"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Professional 3D Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"h","text":"Modelling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hard-surface modelling"},{"text":"Organic modelling"},{"text":"Edge loops"},{"text":"Topology"},{"text":"Subdivision"},{"text":"High-poly modelling"},{"text":"Low-poly modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UV"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UV unwrapping"},{"text":"UV packing"},{"text":"Texel density"},{"text":"Seams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Texturing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PBR workflow"},{"text":"Albedo/base colour"},{"text":"Roughness"},{"text":"Metallic"},{"text":"Normal maps"},{"text":"Ambient occlusion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Blender"},{"text":"Substance 3D Painter"},{"text":"Photoshop"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Game Art + Real-Time Engines","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to make assets game-ready."},{"type":"h","text":"Game Engines"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn one primary engine:"},{"type":"h","text":"Unreal Engine"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Unity"},{"type":"p","text":"For modern high-end game/virtual-production work, Unreal Engine is particularly useful."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asset import"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"LODs"},{"text":"Collision"},{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"Scene construction"},{"text":"Blueprints basics"},{"text":"Real-time rendering"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Specialisation + Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary specialisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Option A"},{"type":"h","text":"Environment Art"},{"type":"h","text":"Option B"},{"type":"h","text":"Character Art"},{"type":"h","text":"Option C"},{"type":"h","text":"Hard-Surface Art"},{"type":"h","text":"Option D"},{"type":"h","text":"Prop Art"},{"type":"h","text":"Option E"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Art"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a professional portfolio around that specialisation."}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Practical Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"3D fundamentals"},{"text":"10–15 basic assets"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Professional modelling/texturing"},{"text":"5–8 polished assets"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Game-engine integration"},{"text":"Complete game environment"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Professional-quality portfolio"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Hard-Surface Prop"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a realistic object such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Camera"},{"text":"Headphones"},{"text":"Mechanical device"},{"text":"Sci-fi weapon"},{"text":"Furniture"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["High Poly","Low Poly","UV",