os"},{"text":"Indie studios"},{"text":"Mobile-game companies"},{"text":"AAA game studios"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Animation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Animation studios"},{"text":"VFX studios"},{"text":"3D production houses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Film/OTT"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VFX studios"},{"text":"Virtual production companies"},{"text":"Previsualisation studios"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advertising"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D advertising agencies"},{"text":"Motion design studios"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AR/VR companies"},{"text":"Metaverse/immersive technology companies"},{"text":"Architectural visualisation studios"},{"text":"Product visualisation companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roles to Target","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D Artist Intern"},{"text":"Game Art Intern"},{"text":"3D Modelling Intern"},{"text":"Environment Art Intern"},{"text":"Character Art Intern"},{"text":"3D Generalist Intern"},{"text":"Texture Artist Intern"},{"text":"Prop Artist Intern"},{"text":"Technical Art Intern"},{"text":"Unreal Engine Artist Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Software Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"h","text":"Blender"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn deeply:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Sculpting"},{"text":"UV"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Rendering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Texturing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Substance 3D Painter"},{"type":"p","text":"Important for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PBR textures"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Baking"},{"text":"Masking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Game Engine"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Unreal Engine"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Unity"},{"type":"h","text":"Optional Advanced Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on specialisation:"},{"type":"h","text":"Character"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ZBrush"},{"text":"Marvelous Designer"},{"text":"Substance 3D"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Environment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SpeedTree"},{"text":"Houdini"},{"text":"Substance Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Animation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maya"},{"text":"MotionBuilder"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Rendering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"Arnold"},{"text":"Redshift"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not try to master every tool simultaneously."}]},{"heading":"Build a Professional Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a 3D Artist, the portfolio is more important than the degree title."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should contain approximately:"},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 excellent projects"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than:"},{"type":"p","text":"30 unfinished projects."},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should show:"},{"type":"h","text":"Reference / Concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Blockout"},{"type":"h","text":"High-Poly Model"},{"type":"h","text":"Low-Poly Model"},{"type":"h","text":"UV"},{"type":"h","text":"Texture"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Render"},{"type":"p","text":"For game-art roles, also show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wireframe"},{"text":"Polygon count"},{"text":"Texture resolution"},{"text":"UV layout"},{"text":"Engine implementation"},{"text":"Optimisation"}]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Platforms","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Maintain a professional portfolio through platforms such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ArtStation"},{"text":"Personal website"},{"text":"Behance"},{"text":"GitHub for technical-art tools/scripts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Your portfolio should clearly state:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software used"},{"text":"Your contribution"},{"text":"Polygon count"},{"text":"Texture workflow"},{"text":"Rendering engine"},{"text":"Project objective"}]}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Sc + strong portfolio:"},{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior 3D Artist"},{"text":"3D Artist"},{"text":"3D Modelling Artist"},{"text":"3D Generalist"},{"text":"Junior Environment Artist"},{"text":"Junior Prop Artist"},{"text":"Junior Character Artist"},{"text":"Texture Artist"},{"text":"Game Artist"},{"text":"3D Visualisation Artist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With Specialisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environment Artist"},{"text":"Character Artist"},{"text":"Hard-Surface Artist"},{"text":"Prop Artist"},{"text":"3D Animator"},{"text":"Lighting Artist"},{"text":"Material Artist"},{"text":"Technical Artist – Junior"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact titles vary across studios."}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Category","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Art"},{"text":"Drawing, composition, colour, anatomy"}],[{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Hard-surface, organic, topology"}],[{"text":"Sculpting"},{"text":"ZBrush/Blender sculpting"}],[{"text":"UV"},{"text":"UV unwrapping, texel density"}],[{"text":"Texturing"},{"text":"PBR, Substance Painter"}],[{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Shader/material creation"}],[{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"Real-time + offline rendering"}],[{"text":"Game Engines"},{"text":"Unreal Engine / Unity"}],[{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"LOD, polygons, texture optimisation"}],[{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Rigging/animation basics"}],[{"text":"Technical"},{"text":"Python/Blueprints basics"}],[{"text":"Portfolio"},{"text":"ArtStation + professional case studies"}]]}]},{"heading":"Learn Basic Technical Art","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If you want stronger long-term career prospects, learn the bridge between art and technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"Unreal Blueprints"},{"text":"Shader basics"},{"text":"Material graphs"},{"text":"P