},{"type":"flow","items":["Concept","AI-assisted generation","Artist refinement","Procedural optimisation","Real-time deployment"]},{"type":"p","text":"Emerging areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative 3D"},{"text":"Text-to-3D"},{"text":"AI texture generation"},{"text":"Neural rendering"},{"text":"Digital humans"},{"text":"Virtual production"},{"text":"Real-time worlds"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Procedural environments"},{"text":"AI-assisted animation"},{"text":"Spatial computing"},{"text":"AR/VR/MR"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest artists will not simply \"use AI.\" They will understand how to evaluate, correct, optimise and integrate AI-generated assets into professional pipelines."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Art Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Modelling"},{"type":"h","text":"Topology"},{"type":"h","text":"UV Mapping"},{"type":"h","text":"PBR Texturing"},{"type":"h","text":"Substance Painter"},{"type":"h","text":"Blender"},{"type":"h","text":"Unreal Engine"},{"type":"h","text":"Lighting & Rendering"},{"type":"h","text":"Game Asset Optimisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Python / Blueprints Basics"},{"type":"h","text":"Procedural & AI-assisted 3D"}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Model high-quality 3D assets."},{"text":"Create clean production topology."},{"text":"UV unwrap assets professionally."},{"text":"Create PBR materials."},{"text":"Texture assets using Substance Painter or equivalent."},{"text":"Create realistic/stylised lighting."},{"text":"Optimise assets for real-time engines."},{"text":"Import and configure assets in Unreal Engine/Unity."},{"text":"Understand basic rigging and animation."},{"text":"Produce professional-quality renders."},{"text":"Explain the complete asset-production